{"parentUuid":"50737b72-b8b4-486f-ae9d-0f89ef40ddcb","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"acb0e47c9637c321b","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CfqhkSxN55vtRQRvbNg69","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All five required test suites pass (confirmed via independent runs, most recently after my final edits): check_system_vocab.py (19/19, new), check_jobs_rules.py (27/27), check_tests_page.py (28/28), check_systems_map_api.py (16/16), check_system_page.py (82/82).\n\nSummary of work:\n\n**Goal A (shared vocabulary)** — `mes-log-mcp/mes/systems.py`: added `normalize_system(text)`, backed by `ALIASES` (electrical-layout tags + free text/monitor names, merged from a new `ELEMENT_TAGS_FOR` table that is the canonical move of `system_detail_bridge.py`'s `_ELEMENT_TAGS_FOR`) and exact key/label matching. `mes-log-mcp/mes/jobs.py`: hypotheses now store a normalized `system` key plus original `system_text` on add/edit; old JSONL records (no `system_text`) are migrated on read via `_fold()`, log never rewritten. `mes-log-mcp/mes/mechanic_tests.py` needed no change — `_t()` already validates `systems` entries against `SYSTEMS` at import time. `cuore/services/jobs_bridge.py`: added `_sys_key()` helper and used it in `_augment_with_liveboard` and `_next_unresolved_test` to compare systems/families through the shared taxonomy instead of raw `.lower()`. `cuore/services/electrical_bridge.py`: added `elements_for_system(key)`, resolving via `mes.systems.ELEMENT_TAGS_FOR`/`normalize_system` instead of ad-hoc tag matching.\n\n**Goal B (per-system VERIFIED_CLEAN)** — `mes-log-mcp/mes/systems.py` also gained `MONITOR_TO_SYSTEM`, `system_for_monitor()`, `monitors_for_system()` (OBD-II Mode 01 monitor names → system keys). `cuore/services/systems_map_bridge.py`'s `system_states()` was rewritten to require, per system: own codes cleared (no ACTIVE) + (no monitor → stays `CLEARED_UNVERIFIED`, or monitor complete on a from-car `dossier_bridge.readiness_panel` reading → `VERIFIED_CLEAN`); the whole-car verdict is no longer consulted at all.\n\nNew test `cuore/tests/check_system_vocab.py` covers all the specified cases, including that a demo-source readiness and a no-monitor system can never yield `VERIFIED_CLEAN` even when the (unused) whole-car verdict says otherwise. No templates, routes, `system_detail_bridge.py`, or job.js/css were touched."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":114,"cache_read_input_tokens":275654,"output_tokens":1420,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":495},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":114},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1420,"cache_read_input_tokens":275654,"cache_creation_input_tokens":114,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":114,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"4159a243-138e-4c0a-a75e-7106c6b3feb8","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfqhkSgF9EndvmhtAbM6d","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"6f5d5e73-c7e5-45af-bc78-550398919894","timestamp":"2026-10-09T00:18:36.613Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
